--- !u!114 &626722355
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 626722353}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 940b8aa489875c840aeae1d0302efd86, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialouge
  textComponent: {fileID: 406681053}
  lines:
  - For thousands of years energy consumption has gone unchecked.
  - Entire systems have been drained, environments eroded, planets abandoned.
  - You have been selected to join the Intergalactic Energy Auditing Company.
  - Every structure you repair brings the galaxy one step closer to balance.
  - Your first assignment awaits.
  spanishLines:
  - "Durante miles de a\xF1os el consumo de energ\xEDa ha estado sin control."
  - Sistemas enteros han sido drenados, los entornos erosionados, los planetas abandonados.
  - "Has sido seleccionado para unirte a la Compa\xF1\xEDa de Auditor\xEDa Energ\xE9tica
    Intergal\xE1ctica."
  - "Cada estructura que reparas acerca a la galaxia un paso m\xE1s al equilibrio."
  - "Te espera tu primera misi\xF3n."
  textSpeed: 0.075
  Panel: {fileID: 626722353}
  button: {fileID: 118923208}
